01:57:51,610 --> 01:57:55,610
And we have good digging capabilities, so the air feels light.

1941
01:57:57,590 --> 01:57:58,350
What does that mean?

1942
01:58:01,770 --> 01:58:03,230
Wait, does that mean what I think it means?

1943
01:58:05,890 --> 01:58:08,410
Like, less of a drop off on spells?

1944
01:58:12,600 --> 01:58:13,000
Whoa!

1945
01:58:16,010 --> 01:58:16,410
Wow.

1946
01:58:18,990 --> 01:58:21,090
Whoa, that was a bit risky on my part there.

1947
01:58:21,250 --> 01:58:21,710
That was bad.

1948
01:58:23,630 --> 01:58:25,010
I have to remember, I have teleport now.

1949
01:58:30,630 --> 01:58:31,210
Uh...

1950
01:58:31,210 --> 01:58:31,910
Oh, that was mine.

1951
01:58:36,780 --> 01:58:38,780
I'm not terribly happy about the bounding burst.

1952
01:58:42,690 --> 01:58:44,690
But I'm very happy about this digging wand.

1953
01:59:00,570 --> 01:59:02,710
Oh, wait, that doesn't get destroyed by that?

1954
01:59:03,590 --> 01:59:04,210
No way.

1955
01:59:08,530 --> 01:59:09,790
Are you kidding me?

1956
01:59:11,530 --> 01:59:13,070
Holy shit, man.

1957
01:59:14,450 --> 01:59:16,610
That was an Ukuskivian in there.

1958
01:59:17,410 --> 01:59:18,490
What the hell?

1959
01:59:19,930 --> 01:59:21,530
Are you actually kidding me?

1960
01:59:23,010 --> 01:59:23,990
That's so unlucky.

1961
01:59:24,470 --> 01:59:27,230
I tried to be safe about it too, you know?

1962
01:59:27,750 --> 01:59:31,590
By shooting the chest first, but I was still in the water in that split second.

1963
01:59:34,780 --> 01:59:35,680
Man, oh man.

1964
01:59:37,000 --> 01:59:38,120
I wasn't fast enough.

1965
01:59:39,640 --> 01:59:40,740
In fact, new rule.

1966
01:59:41,660 --> 01:59:45,460
When the chest is in the water, obviously we shoot the chest.

1967
01:59:46,180 --> 01:59:48,200
But never try to do it from underwater.

1968
01:59:48,400 --> 01:59:49,660
Like, you don't have time to get out.

1969
01:59:50,280 --> 01:59:54,180
You always have to shoot your shot outside of the water.

1970
01:59:55,000 --> 01:59:56,880
Because it is literally instant.

1971
01:59:57,780 --> 01:59:59,480
That electricity spreads so quick.

1972
02:00:00,600 --> 02:00:02,020
Oh, that's a lot of polymorphine.

1973
02:00:05,960 --> 02:00:07,240
I'm gonna blow it up.

1974
02:00:08,560 --> 02:00:09,060
Wait, what?

1975
02:00:10,260 --> 02:00:10,880
There's no trap.

1976
02:00:11,640 --> 02:00:12,960
I guess the polymorphine is the trap.

1977
02:00:17,860 --> 02:00:19,720
Question is, where should I drain it?

1978
02:00:20,480 --> 02:00:21,220
Probably over here.

1979
02:00:29,490 --> 02:00:29,690
Sweet.

1980
02:00:31,590 --> 02:00:32,650
Get rid of it.

1981
02:00:33,450 --> 02:00:34,310
What do I have?

1982
02:00:35,050 --> 02:00:35,490
Swap potion.

1983
02:00:35,710 --> 02:00:36,050
That's fine.

1984
02:00:38,750 --> 02:00:40,050
I can probably take that now.

1985
02:00:42,610 --> 02:00:43,330
That's terrible.

1986
02:00:44,870 --> 02:00:46,670
But it's actually better than I think it is.

1987
02:00:49,310 --> 02:00:51,290
It's a decent wand for now.

1988
02:00:58,410 --> 02:00:59,310
Yeah, I like it.

1989
02:01:02,210 --> 02:01:03,370
You're about to take my wand.

1990
02:01:13,150 --> 02:01:14,810
I'm actually getting my ass kicked today.

1991
02:01:15,050 --> 02:01:16,030
This is insane.

1992
02:01:17,830 --> 02:01:19,070
I'm really getting punished.

1993
02:01:31,650 --> 02:01:34,090
Now you probably understand why I don't want to start Nightmare yet.

1994
02:01:34,510 --> 02:01:36,010
I can't even play the game on normal.

1995
02:01:37,630 --> 02:01:40,230
If this isn't proven enough, then I don't know what is.

1996
02:01:41,410 --> 02:01:41,810
Nice!

1997
02:01:42,270 --> 02:01:42,670
A heart!

1998
02:01:44,030 --> 02:01:45,230
And I have plenty of explosions.

1999
02:01:48,660 --> 02:01:51,160
Wait, I thought it would blow up the bottom part too here.

2000
02:01:52,580 --> 02:01:55,000
Because, oh, I guess that makes sense.

2001
02:01:55,660 --> 02:01:58,120
I guess the steel wall must have absorbed the explosion from here.

2002
02:01:58,140 --> 02:01:58,700
From that angle.

2003
02:02:00,080 --> 02:02:00,940
Didn't consider it.

2004
02:02:03,420 --> 02:02:04,920
Let me put one right here.

2005
02:02:06,860 --> 02:02:07,920
That should do it.

2006
02:02:09,460 --> 02:02:09,660
Nice.

2007
02:02:12,900 --> 02:02:13,760
Very good.

2008
02:02:16,420 --> 02:02:16,820
Berserkium.

2009
02:02:17,420 --> 02:02:17,880
Yes, please.

2010
02:02:20,540 --> 02:02:21,500
Have some of that.

2011
02:02:36,910 --> 02:02:38,750
I don't know why it's called a Berserk curse.

2012
02:02:40,430 --> 02:02:41,870
Like, what is the downside to it?

2013
02:02:44,090 --> 02:02:45,690
I only see upsides.

2014
02:02:46,770 --> 02:02:48,250
Maybe it's like, oh, you're too strong.

2015
02:02:48,410 --> 02:02:50,490
You know, like you will destroy things without knowing it.

2016
02:02:51,030 --> 02:02:52,990
Like you don't know your own strength type of thing.

2017
02:02:54,630 --> 02:02:56,110
I just don't see how that's a bad thing.

2018
02:02:59,090 --> 02:03:00,050
It should not be a curse.

2019
02:03:00,230 --> 02:03:01,330
It should be called a blessing.

2020
02:03:02,610 --> 02:03:04,770
A blessing of Berserk affects you.

2021
02:03:19,150 --> 02:03:19,830
What do we have?

2022
02:03:22,810 --> 02:03:23,190
Nice.

2023
02:03:23,190 --> 02:03:23,710
Nice.

2024
02:03:27,350 --> 02:03:27,790
Yeah.

2025
02:03:28,470 --> 02:03:28,910
Dope.

2026
02:03:29,590 --> 02:03:30,550
You know what that means, right?

2027
02:03:32,310 --> 02:03:33,750
We can go into the dark cave.

2028
02:03:35,290 --> 02:03:36,350
It's draining time.

2029
02:03:41,010 --> 02:03:42,470
And you know how I love to drain.

2030
02:03:53,790 --> 02:03:54,250
I want.

2031
02:04:05,730 --> 02:04:06,790
That's not bad.

2032
02:04:08,290 --> 02:04:08,690
Right?

2033
02:04:10,170 --> 02:04:11,890
Oh, I guess the recharge is kind of shit.

2034
02:04:12,150 --> 02:04:14,710
But look at the mana charge speed on it.

2035
02:04:15,590 --> 02:04:21,810
I mean, there's only two slots, but you can definitely make something very mana intensive with that.

2036
02:04:22,410 --> 02:04:23,790
Like something that costs a lot of mana.

2037
02:04:25,230 --> 02:04:26,870
It's a potential digging wand candidate.

2038
02:04:31,330 --> 02:04:33,630
But you would have to get rid of the recharge.

2039
02:04:36,770 --> 02:04:37,150
Yeah.

2040
02:04:38,770 --> 02:04:40,370
And that's easier said than done.

2041
02:04:41,190 --> 02:04:41,910
With two slots.

2042
02:04:46,390 --> 02:04:46,810
Hey, dude!

2043
02:04:48,530 --> 02:04:49,650
Hand over your money.

2044
02:04:55,130 --> 02:04:56,410
Uh, that's a dead end.

2045
02:04:58,270 --> 02:05:00,170
I could use a black hole, but I'm not gonna.

2046
02:05:03,550 --> 02:05:04,330
Dude, you know what?

2047
02:05:05,450 --> 02:05:15,510
One of the main priorities I need to have in this game is actually to go to the ancient laboratory and kill that boss.

2048
02:05:16,530 --> 02:05:19,150
Because that shit breaks the whole game.

2049
02:05:22,160 --> 02:05:25,180
Like as soon as I'm powerful enough, I actually need to go there.

2050
02:05:26,340 --> 02:05:27,340
That needs to be my...

2051
02:05:28,460 --> 02:05:32,720
Like, I need to know my power level, like when I'm strong enough for that.

2052
02:05:33,620 --> 02:05:36,400
I gotta figure out some kind of consistent way to kill that boss.

2053
02:05:37,360 --> 02:05:40,340
Get his spells and become completely and utterly broken.

2054
02:05:45,690 --> 02:05:46,770
Jesus Christ, my dude.

2055
02:05:48,210 --> 02:05:48,830
Thank you.

2056
02:05:50,830 --> 02:05:51,010
Ow!

2057
02:05:53,930 --> 02:05:54,730
Fuck you!

2058
02:05:56,670 --> 02:05:57,190
Unreal.

2059
02:05:57,190 --> 02:05:57,750
Still.

2060
02:06:02,530 --> 02:06:02,930
Flamoxium.

2061
02:06:06,630 --> 02:06:07,770
Should I... yeah, I'll take it.

2062
02:06:09,790 --> 02:06:11,150
Let's try and pour some on the enemies.

2063
02:06:14,730 --> 02:06:15,790
As though he's confused now.

2064
02:06:17,870 --> 02:06:18,610
What does it do?

2065
02:06:19,110 --> 02:06:20,530
Oh, I thought maybe he would attack his friends.

2066
02:06:23,710 --> 02:06:24,070
Wait!

2067
02:06:25,570 --> 02:06:25,910
Huh?

2068
02:06:27,390 --> 02:06:31,050
I thought for sure that barrel was gonna explode in my face, but instead it became a bush.

2069
02:06:32,590 --> 02:06:33,570
The fuck is that?

2070
02:06:35,950 --> 02:06:38,490
Some divine power is looking out for me right now.

2071
02:06:46,310 --> 02:06:47,710
Oh, you guys want fire?

2072
02:06:51,210 --> 02:06:53,070
Nothing like burned frocks.

2073
02:06:56,910 --> 02:06:59,730
Normally I like frocks, but in this game I kind of hate them.

2074
02:07:08,240 --> 02:07:08,660
That...

2075
02:07:10,420 --> 02:07:11,520
Whatever want there.

2076
02:07:11,620 --> 02:07:12,520
He killed his friend!

2077
02:07:18,630 --> 02:07:19,670
You're not even dead yet.

2078
02:07:23,090 --> 02:07:24,110
Oh my god.

2079
02:07:31,620 --> 02:07:32,280
All right.

2080
02:07:34,760 --> 02:07:36,340
Yeah, this one is not that great.

2081
02:07:37,080 --> 02:07:37,800
Gotta be honest here.

2082
02:07:45,240 --> 02:07:46,660
How are you not dead yet?

2083
02:07:48,740 --> 02:07:49,480
Oh no.

2084
02:07:51,040 --> 02:07:52,100
I need my tablet!

2085
02:07:54,040 --> 02:07:54,360
Sir!

2086
02:07:56,280 --> 02:07:57,040
Fuck you.

2087
02:08:02,880 --> 02:08:03,920
Is he gonna burn alive?

2088
02:08:07,130 --> 02:08:07,410
Haha!

2089
02:08:11,170 --> 02:08:13,030
Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh!

2090
02:08:17,260 --> 02:08:17,820
Ho ho!

2091
02:08:19,440 --> 02:08:20,300
Oh shit!

2092
02:08:25,040 --> 02:08:25,940
Got him.

2093
02:08:30,270 --> 02:08:31,190
Oh no, all the money.

2094
02:08:31,970 --> 02:08:32,110
Fuck.

2095
02:08:41,150 --> 02:08:41,610
Okay.

2096
02:08:42,650 --> 02:08:44,510
I can get to that health in there.

2097
02:08:48,010 --> 02:08:48,270
I think.

2098
02:08:50,030 --> 02:08:50,490
Whoops.

2099
02:08:52,230 --> 02:08:53,570
Here I can prop...

2100
02:08:53,570 --> 02:08:54,270
Oh, wait!

2101
02:08:57,370 --> 02:08:58,110
I don't...

2102
02:08:58,110 --> 02:08:58,330
Wait.

2103
02:08:59,510 --> 02:08:59,970
This digs.

2104
02:09:01,590 --> 02:09:01,930
Fuck!

2105
02:09:02,070 --> 02:09:03,350
I don't have money for the black hole.

2106
02:09:03,510 --> 02:09:04,090
I mean, mana.

2107
02:09:04,390 --> 02:09:05,810
Why didn't I think about that?

2108
02:09:06,830 --> 02:09:10,710
I was operating under the assumption that I had enough.

2109
02:09:12,350 --> 02:09:13,150
Oh, but never mind.

2110
02:09:14,790 --> 02:09:15,490
I do!

2111
02:09:17,490 --> 02:09:18,190
Let's go.

2112
02:09:23,030 --> 02:09:24,370
What do you say to that?

2113
02:09:27,210 --> 02:09:27,690
Drain it.

2114
02:09:29,310 --> 02:09:30,990
I may just take this just to have one more.

2115
02:09:31,650 --> 02:09:32,970
I do like the magic bolt.

2116
02:09:33,450 --> 02:09:34,470
Now I'm keeping the magic bolt.

2117
02:09:36,990 --> 02:09:38,970
I feel like a wand with that could be insane.

2118
02:09:47,270 --> 02:09:47,990
Wait a minute.

2119
02:09:48,690 --> 02:09:49,530
Is there a worm here?

2120
02:09:51,230 --> 02:09:51,770
Look at this.

2121
02:09:51,770 --> 02:09:52,970
This is totally the work of a worm.

2122
02:09:55,930 --> 02:09:56,730
Oh no.

2123
02:10:01,760 --> 02:10:02,640
Tell me it's dead.

2124
02:10:05,140 --> 02:10:06,020
Oh no.

2125
02:10:09,360 --> 02:10:10,020
We're done.

2126
02:10:12,400 --> 02:10:13,020
That's it.

2127
02:10:14,220 --> 02:10:14,640
It's over.

2128
02:10:17,840 --> 02:10:19,620
I need to find a tablet immediately.

2129
02:10:20,080 --> 02:10:21,540
It's the only real option I have.

2130
02:10:22,660 --> 02:10:24,940
And then hope to god I can kill him with one hit.

2131
02:10:26,460 --> 02:10:28,800
I gotta pull out some special strats here.

2132
02:10:32,710 --> 02:10:35,690
Also, can I get rid of this damn mud or whatever it is?

2133
02:10:36,770 --> 02:10:37,610
I need proper water.

2134
02:10:40,720 --> 02:10:41,780
Don't care for swamp.

2135
02:10:50,300 --> 02:10:50,800
There we go.

2136
02:10:54,600 --> 02:10:55,680
So how do I do this?

2137
02:10:56,340 --> 02:10:58,620
What I could do is go to the mountain.

2138
02:10:58,620 --> 02:11:01,580
Hopefully get a...

2139
02:11:03,200 --> 02:11:05,440
Hopefully get a chain bolt.

2140
02:11:06,080 --> 02:11:07,920
Because that's a certified way of doing it.

2141
02:11:07,960 --> 02:11:09,860
Then I use a black hole and I use a tablet.

2142
02:11:11,860 --> 02:11:13,060
To block myself in.

2143
02:11:13,520 --> 02:11:14,640
That's the proven strategy.

2144
02:11:18,200 --> 02:11:19,320
But if I can't do that...

2145
02:11:20,680 --> 02:11:21,460
It's tablet time.

2146
02:11:22,680 --> 02:11:23,840
And I just, I can't miss.

2147
02:11:24,160 --> 02:11:25,280
It needs to be the perfect throw.

2148
02:11:26,780 --> 02:11:27,960
There you are, you fucker.

2149
02:11:28,680 --> 02:11:29,800
Well, you already did the...

2150
02:11:30,440 --> 02:11:32,040
You already made a mess, didn't you?

2151
02:11:33,680 --> 02:11:34,560
Oh, but you know what?

2152
02:11:36,340 --> 02:11:38,080
I can drink the shit and go into the cave.

2153
02:11:38,360 --> 02:11:39,560
But he's gone now.

2154
02:11:41,380 --> 02:11:42,440
He went down there.

2155
02:11:50,190 --> 02:11:50,990
Oh god.

2156
02:11:52,050 --> 02:11:52,770
Maybe this is better.

2157
02:11:54,550 --> 02:11:56,050
I don't like my primary wand.

2158
02:11:57,670 --> 02:11:59,850
I need to empty this one.

2159
02:12:02,130 --> 02:12:03,510
And get some worm blood.

2160
02:12:13,290 --> 02:12:15,290
Drink the, uh, persecium.

2161
02:12:20,110 --> 02:12:21,810
Okay, okay, okay, okay.

2162
02:12:22,610 --> 02:12:23,510
Not bad, not bad.

2163
02:12:25,070 --> 02:12:26,130
Doing some good damage here.

2164
02:12:32,800 --> 02:12:33,720
How are you not dead?

2165
02:12:35,380 --> 02:12:36,400
There we go.

2166
02:12:37,580 --> 02:12:37,980
Beautiful.

2167
02:12:39,500 --> 02:12:40,720
And now we empty this.

2168
02:12:41,720 --> 02:12:42,480
We get the worm blood.

2169
02:12:44,420 --> 02:12:47,660
If we're going to have any chance against Stewart, we're going to need more HP.

2170
02:12:53,740 --> 02:12:54,660
Get in here.

2171
02:12:55,540 --> 02:12:56,080
So I have...

2172
02:12:57,020 --> 02:12:57,360
That's fine.

2173
02:12:59,260 --> 02:12:59,740
Pick it up.

2174
02:13:03,740 --> 02:13:04,240
Oh yeah.

2175
02:13:06,530 --> 02:13:07,710
Oh yeah, that's it.

2176
02:13:08,350 --> 02:13:08,830
That's it.

2177
02:13:09,750 --> 02:13:10,970
There's worm pheromone here.

2178
02:13:12,230 --> 02:13:13,410
Alright, let's go pick up a tablet.

2179
02:13:27,750 --> 02:13:28,590
Oh my god.

2180
02:13:35,950 --> 02:13:36,790
I got him.

2181
02:13:44,910 --> 02:13:45,610
Not bad.

2182
02:13:48,650 --> 02:13:50,390
I still have two black holes left.

2183
02:13:51,930 --> 02:13:54,170
Oh, that's a lot of water.

2184
02:13:57,870 --> 02:14:02,550
You know what, I kind of want to blow up and make all this into, uh, stone.

2185
02:14:02,950 --> 02:14:03,110
Hold on.

2186
02:14:04,410 --> 02:14:04,810
Can I?

2187
02:14:05,770 --> 02:14:07,270
Nah, it's not that easy.

2188
02:14:08,270 --> 02:14:09,550
It does actually kind of spread in there, look.

2189
02:14:18,690 --> 02:14:19,170
Shit, shit.

2190
02:14:20,090 --> 02:14:21,170
That was a bit too close there.

2191
02:14:29,160 --> 02:14:29,960
Alright, here we are.

2192
02:14:31,140 --> 02:14:32,280
So what am I going to throw away?

2193
02:14:32,820 --> 02:14:33,940
Probably the unstable teleport.

2194
02:14:34,140 --> 02:14:35,240
Let's put it down gently.

2195
02:14:36,600 --> 02:14:37,280
Fuck!

2196
02:14:41,210 --> 02:14:42,470
I put it down gently!

2197
02:14:44,990 --> 02:14:46,230
Oh man.

2198
02:14:50,170 --> 02:14:51,970
What is this?

2199
02:14:52,850 --> 02:14:54,170
That was honestly funny.

2200
02:14:55,030 --> 02:14:55,930
I can't be mad.

2201
02:14:56,250 --> 02:14:56,850
That was funny.

2202
02:14:59,050 --> 02:15:00,410
Fucking into the lava.

2203
02:15:01,350 --> 02:15:02,250
That's the worst.

2204
02:15:04,050 --> 02:15:06,250
I don't think that's ever happened to me.

2205
02:15:06,790 --> 02:15:07,450
That's a first.

2206
02:15:08,810 --> 02:15:10,070
Holy shit.

2207
02:15:12,190 --> 02:15:12,550
Yikes.

2208
02:15:14,170 --> 02:15:17,990
I have a newfound fear of unstable teleportation, guys.

2209
02:15:18,830 --> 02:15:19,890
That was bad.

2210
02:15:21,730 --> 02:15:22,930
That was not good.

2211
02:15:23,710 --> 02:15:26,470
Oh, this is going to take 1.4 million years.

2212
02:15:28,390 --> 02:15:29,110
I gotta wait a bit.

2213
02:15:36,640 --> 02:15:37,220
That one.

2214
02:15:38,600 --> 02:15:39,220
Be patient.

2215
02:15:41,720 --> 02:15:42,000
