3869
03:48:23,290 --> 03:48:24,170
No, it's just the heads.

3870
03:48:43,820 --> 03:48:45,040
Oh, no, no.

3871
03:48:46,680 --> 03:48:48,840
Oh man, they took a lot of HP from me there.

3872
03:48:50,620 --> 03:48:52,100
Thieves, stealing my HP.

3873
03:49:12,050 --> 03:49:12,810
There we go.

3874
03:49:14,530 --> 03:49:15,330
Taking care of.

3875
03:49:17,070 --> 03:49:18,110
Yeah, I need digging.

3876
