I should have put some light on this instead.

3885
03:50:00,370 --> 03:50:01,310
I now regret my actions.

3886
03:50:08,310 --> 03:50:09,330
Yeah, look at that.

3887
03:50:09,670 --> 03:50:11,050
I thought someone shot at me.

3888
03:50:20,760 --> 03:50:21,760
It's hard to tell what's mine.

3889
03:50:27,770 --> 03:50:30,270
I just want to go to the inverted pyramid right now.

3890
03:50:32,790 --> 03:50:34,490
And then I want to grab the health here.

3891
03:50:37,050 --> 03:50:37,190
Oh.

3892
03:50:40,230 --> 03:50:40,890
Concentrated light.

3893
03:50:44,600 --> 03:50:45,560
I think I want it.

3894
03:50:47,720 --> 03:50:52,020
That's a spell I kind of want to make a wand out of at some point, because it seems really cool.

3895
03:50:52,580 --> 03:50:54,180
I love the effect of it when you shoot it.

3896
03:50:55,360 --> 03:50:58,380
It's very pleasing to the eye and the ears.

3897
03:51:00,800 --> 03:51:02,080
Sometimes that's all that matters.

3898
03:51:20,720 --> 03:51:21,760
Going pretty well.

3899
03:51:40,720 --> 03:51:41,440
Shoots the heart.

3900
03:51:43,020 --> 03:51:44,300
That's the pheromone shot.

3901
03:51:45,800 --> 03:51:46,140
Or is it?

3902
03:51:47,840 --> 03:51:48,460
I'm not sure.

3903
03:51:59,370 --> 03:52:00,330
Here it is.

3904
03:52:01,850 --> 03:52:02,730
The orb room.

3905
03:52:06,100 --> 03:52:07,920
Interesting that it's just called the orb room.

3906
03:52:10,280 --> 03:52:11,640
Oh, here we go.

3907
03:52:14,910 --> 03:52:16,430
All right, let me take some pictures.

3908
03:52:26,990 --> 03:52:27,810
Second picture.

3909
03:52:40,060 --> 03:52:40,360
Here.

3910
03:52:42,260 --> 03:52:43,680
Okay, I got it.

3911
03:52:45,900 --> 03:52:48,180
Let's find the letters we need now.

3912
03:52:53,520 --> 03:52:54,340
