A, B, C, D, E.

3914
03:52:56,000 --> 03:52:57,760
We need a capital E.

3915
03:52:58,900 --> 03:52:59,540
Do we have it?

3916
03:53:01,400 --> 03:53:02,200
We do.

3917
03:53:03,980 --> 03:53:11,640
It's basically like an O again, but more like a triangular or a diamond D shape.

3918
03:53:15,090 --> 03:53:15,830
You know what?

3919
03:53:15,890 --> 03:53:17,450
Let me make this tiny bit smaller.

3920
03:53:21,840 --> 03:53:23,130
That way we have some room here.

3921
03:53:24,760 --> 03:53:26,920
A, B, C, D, E.

3922
03:53:34,400 --> 03:53:35,740
So E is like this.

3923
03:53:41,530 --> 03:53:41,970
There we go.

3924
03:53:44,550 --> 03:53:45,130
Do we have a C?

3925
03:53:48,210 --> 03:53:50,390
Emerald tablet volume B.

3926
03:53:50,750 --> 03:53:51,450
Volume five.

3927
03:53:52,870 --> 03:53:57,810
Okay, so no capital C unless it appears in the text.

3928
03:54:05,100 --> 03:54:08,060
I'm just realizing maybe there's some kind of cipher hidden in this.

3929
03:54:10,120 --> 03:54:12,880
Interestingly, they also catalyze a lot of letters in the text.

3930
03:54:15,900 --> 03:54:19,040
There's got to be a capital C somewhere.

3931
03:54:24,140 --> 03:54:24,740
There's count.

3932
03:54:27,020 --> 03:54:27,700
Once.

3933
03:54:29,680 --> 03:54:30,720
What else are we needing?

3934
03:54:32,140 --> 03:54:35,920
A, B, C, D, E, F.

3935
03:54:37,840 --> 03:54:38,820
Do we have an F?

3936
03:54:40,120 --> 03:54:41,460
We do first.

3937
03:54:45,140 --> 03:54:47,120
Oh, but there's like a little apostrophe as well.

3938
03:54:48,400 --> 03:54:51,060
Even that is like translated.

3939
03:54:53,540 --> 03:54:56,800
So big F is like a weird K with a missing line.

3940
03:55:01,450 --> 03:55:02,970
So we got to write like this.

3941
03:55:05,390 --> 03:55:06,250
Let's see here.

3942
03:55:10,210 --> 03:55:10,770
Like that.

3943
03:55:12,210 --> 03:55:12,850
That's a K.

3944
03:55:13,310 --> 03:55:14,770
No, that's an F.

3945
03:55:18,350 --> 03:55:19,390
Capital H.

3946
03:55:19,690 --> 03:55:20,230
Do we have that?

3947
03:55:24,030 --> 03:55:24,590
Capital H maybe.

3948
03:55:26,190 --> 03:55:28,310
We do holy hand grenade.

3949
03:55:29,070 --> 03:55:29,950
One, two, three, four.

3950
03:55:30,750 --> 03:55:31,770
One, two, three, four.

3951
03:55:31,970 --> 03:55:32,790
It's an R.

3952
03:55:35,250 --> 03:55:36,330
With a colon.

3953
03:55:37,290 --> 03:55:41,350
All E, holy hand.

3954
03:55:42,330 --> 03:55:43,110
Oh yeah, it is.

3955
03:55:43,650 --> 03:55:45,230
R with a colon.

3956
03:55:50,470 --> 03:55:51,690
Very cool.

3957
03:56:00,180 --> 03:56:00,860
There we go.

3958
03:56:01,620 --> 03:56:02,260
That's the H.

3959
03:56:03,440 --> 03:56:03,540
J.

3960
03:56:07,190 --> 03:56:08,530
Show me the J.

3961
03:56:10,590 --> 03:56:12,170
J is elusive, man.

3962
03:56:13,950 --> 03:56:15,070
Where is the number J?

3963
03:56:15,070 --> 03:56:15,110
J.

3964
03:56:22,750 --> 03:56:31,150
Lobest thou thy holy hand grenade of Antioch towards thy foe, who being naughty in my sight shall snuff it.

3965
03:56:34,910 --> 03:56:35,590
There's no J.

3966
03:56:37,570 --> 03:56:38,690
All right, that's fine.

3967
03:56:42,760 --> 03:56:43,340
How about an O?

3968
03:56:43,920 --> 03:56:44,740
Oh yeah, we have that.

3969
03:56:45,840 --> 03:56:46,100
Volume.

3970
03:56:49,120 --> 03:56:53,400
It's sort of the same as the O.

3971
03:56:53,880 --> 03:56:55,760
That is not capitalized.

3972
03:56:57,340 --> 03:56:58,440
But a little different.

3973
03:57:04,530 --> 03:57:05,970
Let me do this in two rows here.

3974
03:57:11,190 --> 03:57:11,590
Like that.

3975
03:57:18,470 --> 03:57:23,330
So O is like this weird L.

3976
03:57:26,190 --> 03:57:26,730
Like that.

3977
03:57:27,930 --> 03:57:28,330
Big O.

3978
03:57:34,570 --> 03:57:35,250
What about K?

3979
03:57:36,630 --> 03:57:37,490
Do we have a K?

3980
03:57:47,280 --> 03:57:48,120
There's no K.

3981
03:57:48,120 --> 03:57:51,700
At least not a not a capital K.

3982
03:57:55,910 --> 03:57:56,270
Damn it.

3983
03:57:58,410 --> 03:57:58,990
Damn it.

3984
03:57:59,350 --> 03:57:59,550
Okay.

3985
03:58:05,040 --> 03:58:05,940
P maybe.

3986
03:58:13,350 --> 03:58:13,910
Not that I...

3987
03:58:13,910 --> 03:58:14,710
Oh, holy pin.

3988
03:58:15,130 --> 03:58:21,070
We got a P. It's a weird X again.

3989
03:58:22,630 --> 03:58:23,870
Was P also an X over here?

3990
03:58:24,070 --> 03:58:26,370
It was, but it's a different X this time.

3991
03:58:26,890 --> 03:58:27,510
Not that it matters.

3992
03:58:27,510 --> 03:58:30,270
I mean, does it matter if it's capitalized or not?

3993
03:58:30,330 --> 03:58:31,210
It's very similar.

3994
03:58:32,850 --> 03:58:33,350
Like look at this.

3995
03:58:33,590 --> 03:58:36,570
The arrow here is very similar to the S here.

3996
03:58:37,110 --> 03:58:38,870
It's not quite an arrow, but it's like...

3997
03:58:40,270 --> 03:58:41,110
Some of them are different.

3998
03:58:41,210 --> 03:58:42,650
Some of them are not, basically.

3999
03:58:44,550 --> 03:58:45,850
So this one is more like this.

4000
03:58:49,240 --> 03:58:52,300
And then it has a little like that.

4001
03:58:54,700 --> 03:59:06,930
That's a P. T-U-V is the question mark.

4002
03:59:10,570 --> 03:59:11,590
There we go.

4003
03:59:14,830 --> 03:59:15,850
Very cool.

4004
03:59:18,770 --> 03:59:19,830
H-F.

4005
03:59:20,190 --> 03:59:21,030
All that we got.

4006
03:59:22,830 --> 03:59:23,830
What about big N?

4007
03:59:24,410 --> 03:59:25,170
Oh, we have that already.

4008
03:59:25,530 --> 03:59:25,570
Cool.

4009
03:59:27,450 --> 03:59:27,990
Big M.

4010
03:59:28,290 --> 03:59:29,190
We have that one too.

4011
03:59:33,650 --> 03:59:34,110
Big L.

4012
03:59:34,910 --> 03:59:35,650
Big L.

4013
03:59:35,990 --> 03:59:36,410
Rest in peace.

4014
03:59:43,560 --> 03:59:45,760
Okay, I think we're slowly getting there.

4015
03:59:46,140 --> 03:59:47,600
Now let's see the non-capital letters.

4016
03:59:48,480 --> 03:59:50,440
A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J.

4017
03:59:51,100 --> 03:59:52,800
There's got to be a small J here somewhere.

4018
03:59:53,800 --> 03:59:56,440
I refuse to believe it, but there's not.

4019
04:00:05,210 --> 04:00:05,830
There's not.

4020
04:00:08,010 --> 04:00:08,790
Wow, okay.

4021
04:00:10,250 --> 04:00:10,550
K then.

4022
04:00:10,790 --> 04:00:11,390
There's got to be a K.

4023
04:00:13,250 --> 04:00:13,830
There is.

4024
04:00:15,210 --> 04:00:16,550
First, shalt thou take...

4025
04:00:18,990 --> 04:00:20,670
one, two, three, four.

4026
04:00:21,950 --> 04:00:23,310
One, two, three, four.

4027
04:00:25,670 --> 04:00:26,730
It's an R.

4028
04:00:29,030 --> 04:00:29,470
What?

4029
04:00:35,320 --> 04:00:35,840
Whoa, hold on.

4030
04:00:36,020 --> 04:00:37,360
That's got to be a mistake.

4031
04:00:40,890 --> 04:00:42,770
One, two, three, four.

4032
04:00:43,050 --> 04:00:43,750
And it's the third.

4033
04:00:45,170 --> 04:00:46,170
One, two, three, four.

4034
04:00:46,310 --> 04:00:46,590
Oh yeah.

4035
04:00:46,810 --> 04:00:48,150
Oh, it's just the R without the colon.

4036
04:00:48,510 --> 04:00:48,610
Interesting.

4037
04:00:55,430 --> 04:00:56,410
That comes before L.

4038
04:00:59,090 --> 04:00:59,710
Oh no, wait.

4039
04:01:00,710 --> 04:01:01,250
Non-capitalized.

4040
04:01:07,240 --> 04:01:07,500
Hold on.

4041
04:01:07,660 --> 04:01:09,640
A, B, C, D, E, F, G, O, E, L, C.

4042
04:01:11,720 --> 04:01:12,080
K.

4043
04:01:12,980 --> 04:01:13,640
It's just the R.

4044
04:01:16,040 --> 04:01:17,800
I like the weird looking R.

4045
04:01:20,260 --> 04:01:20,620
Okay.

4046
04:01:22,000 --> 04:01:22,360
Nice.

4047
04:01:24,840 --> 04:01:26,460
L, M, N, O, P, Q.

4048
04:01:26,460 --> 04:01:27,860
There's no Q here, I don't think.

4049
04:01:29,700 --> 04:01:31,000
That's kind of a rare letter.

4050
04:01:33,200 --> 04:01:35,300
Unless quest is mentioned.

4051
04:01:37,240 --> 04:01:37,880
Or quite.

4052
04:01:44,620 --> 04:01:44,960
Antioch.

4053
04:01:45,480 --> 04:01:49,160
Hold on, we have a C already.

4054
04:01:50,200 --> 04:01:51,020
Towards life bow.

4055
04:01:53,500 --> 04:01:53,880
Okay.

4056
04:01:55,440 --> 04:01:56,400
We got that.

4057
04:01:59,020 --> 04:01:59,840
X, Y.

4058
04:02:00,620 --> 04:02:01,600
Do we have a Y?

4059
04:02:04,850 --> 04:02:05,630
That's quite a norm.

4060
04:02:05,810 --> 04:02:06,330
We do.

4061
04:02:06,330 --> 04:02:08,010
Lobbest thou thy.

4062
04:02:10,310 --> 04:02:13,070
Lobbest thou thy.

4063
04:02:13,310 --> 04:02:13,650
Okay.

4064
04:02:13,950 --> 04:02:16,010
So that's like a weird thingy.

4065
04:02:16,970 --> 04:02:18,130
Looks like this.

4066
04:02:20,170 --> 04:02:20,790
Lobbest thou.

4067
04:02:21,490 --> 04:02:21,950
Nope.

4068
04:02:22,810 --> 04:02:23,490
I fucked it up.

4069
04:02:25,950 --> 04:02:26,450
Like that.

4070
04:02:28,870 --> 04:02:29,310
Is that right?

4071
04:02:30,750 --> 04:02:31,610
Lobbest thou thy.

4072
04:02:32,730 --> 04:02:33,950
No, it's kind of wrong.

4073
04:02:35,110 --> 04:02:35,870
It's like this.

4074
04:02:38,630 --> 04:02:39,350
That's why.

4075
04:02:40,310 --> 04:02:41,190
We got it.

4076
04:02:47,390 --> 04:02:48,350
But wait, where's the A?

4077
04:02:49,730 --> 04:02:50,690
And O.

4078
04:02:53,510 --> 04:02:54,410
Nah, kidding.

4079
04:02:55,630 --> 04:02:56,450
That's the Danish language.

4080
04:02:57,390 --> 04:02:57,990
We don't do that here.

4081
04:03:00,290 --> 04:03:02,890
Let's see if we can find some comma and shit.

4082
04:03:04,330 --> 04:03:04,990
So comma is...

4083
04:03:05,970 --> 04:03:07,830
Yeah, comma is quite confirmed there.

4084
04:03:08,030 --> 04:03:10,270
So a dot punctuation mark.

4085
04:03:11,410 --> 04:03:12,290
That's three dots.

4086
04:03:18,700 --> 04:03:19,120
One dot.

4087
04:03:20,240 --> 04:03:20,600
Cool.

4088
04:03:25,450 --> 04:03:26,610
All right, we got commas.

4089
04:03:27,370 --> 04:03:28,110
What about a dash?

4090
04:03:28,710 --> 04:03:29,870
A dash is a little arrow.

4091
04:03:35,770 --> 04:03:36,170
Cool.

4092
04:03:39,570 --> 04:03:40,470
That's really neat.

4093
04:03:41,810 --> 04:03:43,230
We're going to put a title for this, by the way.

4094
04:03:43,310 --> 04:03:44,450
This has to be called...

4095
04:03:45,290 --> 04:03:46,250
Oh man, of course.

4096
04:03:46,390 --> 04:03:50,010
It's got to be called a reset of stone, given that we're taking the stones and using this.

4097
04:03:55,430 --> 04:03:56,170
It's got to be...

4098
04:04:04,910 --> 04:04:05,950
a reset of stone.

4099
04:04:07,510 --> 04:04:08,770
What a beautiful stone it is.

4100
04:04:11,350 --> 04:04:12,250
Make it a bit bigger.

4101
04:04:20,500 --> 04:04:21,100
There we go.

4102
04:04:23,260 --> 04:04:23,740
Awesome.

4103
04:04:25,780 --> 04:04:27,820
But that's it, because now we're going to keep going.

4104
04:04:29,360 --> 04:04:29,660
Awesome.

4105
04:04:29,760 --> 04:04:31,860
More translation has been done.

4106
04:04:32,480 --> 04:04:36,940
I'm sure I missed a couple letters there, but let's find another tablet and continue on.

4107
04:04:38,240 --> 04:04:38,860
What's up, fool?

4108
04:04:41,240 --> 04:04:42,440
Whoever you are, you're dead.

4109
04:04:50,070 --> 04:04:51,710
Now I kind of want to find the book in...

4110
04:04:53,350 --> 04:04:54,350
What's that place called?

4111
04:04:55,690 --> 04:04:57,310
The fungal caverns.

4112
04:04:58,250 --> 04:05:02,230
If I remember correctly, that also is being translated live when you mouse over it.

4113
04:05:03,670 --> 04:05:04,730
Wait, how am I going to get in there?

4114
04:05:06,790 --> 04:05:07,830
I think over here is okay.

4115
04:05:12,400 --> 04:05:14,280
I mean, we also have the tablet on top of the mountain.

4116
04:05:15,620 --> 04:05:16,820
We can go check out, of course.

4117
04:05:18,500 --> 04:05:21,000
I can't wait to get to all the...

4118
04:05:21,000 --> 04:05:23,980
the pyramid and all the other places where we know there's text.

4119
04:05:27,450 --> 04:05:28,830
Dude, even the start of the game.

4120
04:05:29,770 --> 04:05:32,570
The stone monuments there have text on them as well.

4121
04:05:35,790 --> 04:05:37,450
Oh, it's got to be so much fun.

4122
04:05:38,890 --> 04:05:40,310
We're finally going to get to the bottom of this.

4123
04:05:40,390 --> 04:05:40,730
What is that?

4124
04:05:40,950 --> 04:05:41,430
It's wax.

4125
04:05:42,570 --> 04:05:42,610
Okay.

4126
04:05:46,310 --> 04:05:47,730
As in a candle or what?

4127
04:05:51,000 --> 04:05:51,420
Wait, what's that?

4128
04:05:51,420 --> 04:05:52,400
That's a wand.

4129
04:05:56,700 --> 04:05:57,960
I'm just clearing for enemies here.

4130
04:05:58,140 --> 04:06:01,320
Oh, he died.

4131
04:06:04,780 --> 04:06:05,420
What's that?

4132
04:06:05,980 --> 04:06:06,480
That's bone.

4133
04:06:07,560 --> 04:06:08,240
Can I eat bone?

4134
04:06:21,230 --> 04:06:23,410
Is there really no good way in?

4135
04:06:25,870 --> 04:06:27,590
That is almost unbelievable.

4136
04:06:29,010 --> 04:06:30,930
I may have to use this wand just for this purpose.

4137
04:06:32,830 --> 04:06:34,330
That does cut, right?

4138
04:06:35,490 --> 04:06:36,670
Oh wait, does this damage me?

4139
04:06:38,710 --> 04:06:39,150
Oh, it doesn't.

4140
04:06:39,370 --> 04:06:39,710
Okay, thank God.

4141
04:06:40,530 --> 04:06:41,730
